2px;"> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">“You” or “your” means any person who uses our website or services, including customers, visitors and people who contact our customer support team.</p> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Please read this Privacy Policy carefully so you understand how we handle your personal information.</p> <div style="margin-top: 48px;"> <h2 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">1. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. This may happen when our business, website features, technology, service providers or legal requirements change.</p> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">When we update this Privacy Policy, we will publish the new version on this page and update the “Last updated” date above.</p> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Where required by law, we will notify you of important changes and ask for your consent again if needed.</p> </div> <div style="margin-top: 48px;"> <h2 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">2. Who is responsible for your personal information?</h2> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">For the purposes of applicable data protection laws, including the GR GDPR and EU GDPR where applicable, AUREA Mykonos is responsible for the personal information collected through this website.</p> </div> <div style="margin-top: 48px;"> <h2 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">3. Personal information we collect</h2> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">The personal information we collect depends on how you interact with our website and services. Personal information means information that identifies you directly or can reasonably be linked to you.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">3.1 Information you provide to us</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">You may provide personal information when you place an order, contact us, create an account, subscribe to marketing, leave a review, or otherwise interact with our website. This may include:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Contact details, such as your name, email address, phone number, billing address and delivery address</li> <li>Order information, such as the products you buy, order value, order number, delivery method and order-related communication</li> <li>Account information, such as login details, account preferences and security information</li> <li>Customer support information, such as messages, questions, complaints, return requests, feedback or other information you send to us</li> <li>Marketing preferences, such as whether you have subscribed to our emails or opted out of marketing communication</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">You can choose not to provide certain information, but this may mean we cannot provide some services to you, such as processing an order or arranging delivery.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">3.2 Information collected automatically</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">When you visit or use our website, certain information may be collected automatically through cookies, pixels and similar technologies. This may include:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Device type, browser type and operating system</li> <li>IP address and approximate location</li> <li>Pages viewed and links clicked</li> <li>Date, time and length of your visit</li> <li>How you arrived at our website, such as through a search engine, advertisement, email or social media platform</li> <li>Shopping activity on our website, such as products viewed, items added to cart and checkout activity</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We use this information to operate the website, improve the customer experience, measure performance and support advertising and analytics.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">3.3 Information from third parties</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We may receive information about you from third parties that help us operate our store and provide our services. This may include:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Platform providers that host our online store and support checkout, order processing and store functionality</li> <li>Payment providers, which process payments and confirm payment status</li> <li>Delivery and fulfilment partners, which help us process, ship and deliver orders</li> <li>Analytics and advertising partners, which help us understand website performance and measure marketing activity</li> <li>Customer support tools, which help us respond to questions, returns and complaints</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Any information received from third parties is handled in line with this Privacy Policy.</p> </div> <div style="margin-top: 48px;"> <h2 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">4. How we use your personal information</h2> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We use your personal information for the purposes described below.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">4.1 To provide our products and services</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We use your information to:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Process and manage your orders</li> <li>Take and confirm payment</li> <li>Arrange delivery and fulfilment</li> <li>Send order confirmations, shipping updates and transactional messages</li> <li>Handle returns, refunds and exchanges</li> <li>Provide customer service and respond to your questions</li> <li>Manage customer accounts, where applicable</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">This processing is necessary to provide our services to you and to fulfil our contract with you.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">4.2 To communicate with you</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We may use your contact details to:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Respond to your messages or support requests</li> <li>Send order-related updates</li> <li>Ask for information needed to process your order, return or refund</li> <li>Notify you about important service or policy updates</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">These messages are usually necessary for customer service, order management or legal reasons.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">4.3 Marketing and advertising</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Where permitted by law, we may use your information to:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Send promotional emails or offers</li> <li>Show relevant advertisements on our website or on other platforms</li> <li>Measure the performance of our advertising campaigns</li> <li>Understand which products, offers or pages may be relevant to customers</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">Where required, we will only send direct marketing if you have given consent. You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time by using the unsubscribe link in the email or by contacting us.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">4.4 Website improvement and analytics</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We use website and usage information to:</p> <ul style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 4px 0px 16px; padding-left: 22px;"> <li>Understand how visitors use our website</li> <li>Improve website performance and layout</li> <li>Identify technical problems or errors</li> <li>Improve our products, content and customer experience</li> <li>Measure the effectiveness of marketing campaigns</li> </ul> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">This helps us operate and improve our business in a secure and efficient way.</p> <h3 style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 22px 0px 6px;">4.5 Security, fraud prevention and legal compliance</h3> <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 16px;">We may use your personal information to:</p> <u